@startuml activity-voice-question
!include style.iuml
title Asking by voice and listening to the answer (activity, ADR-012)

|Person|
start
:Tap the microphone (the text box is empty);
|Phone app|
:Ask the phone's speech service if it can listen;
if (Ready?) then (no permission)
  :Say how to allow the microphone;
  stop
elseif () then (not available)
  :Hide the microphone; typing still works;
  stop
else (ready)
endif
:Listen in English: show the words as they
are recognised and a sound-level bar;
|Person|
if (What next?) then (tap ✕)
  |Phone app|
  :Throw the words away;
  stop
else (tap ✓, or 3 s of silence, or 60 s)
endif
|Phone app|
:Put the words in the text box;
note right
  Only text leaves the phone:
  the voice is turned into text
  by the phone's speech service.
end note
|Person|
:Read the words, correct them if needed,
then tap Send;
|Phone app|
:Send the question (see "How the assistant
answers a message");
:Show the answer;
|Person|
if (Tap "Listen"?) then (yes)
  |Phone app|
  :Phone's text-to-speech reads the answer;
  :Tap again to stop;
endif
stop
@enduml
